abel{sec:gap}\n146:\\subsection{Main comparison: sealed final evaluation}\n213:\\subsection{Where the gain is large, and where it is not}\n241:\\subsection{Negative controls}\\label{sec:controls}\n249:\\subsection{Reporter variants considered during development}\n275:\\section{Discussion and Limitations}\\label{sec:limits}\n285:\\section{Conclusion}\n299:\\section{Supplementary Information}\n300:\\subsection{Estimator details and hyperparameters}\n326:\\subsection{Evaluation protocol and provenance}\n334:\\subsection{Per-case detail}\n385:\\subsection{Reproducibility}\n388:\\subsection{LLM Usage}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
